MOS2 small signal: active-load common-source stage, Meyer and junction charge at 75 C
vdd vdd 0 5
vin gate 0 dc 1.03 ac 1
vbias pg 0 3.6
m1 drain gate 0 0 mn w=8u l=2u m=2 ad=24p as=24p pd=22u ps=22u
m2 drain pg vdd vdd mp w=16u l=2u ad=48p as=48p pd=38u ps=38u
cl drain 0 50f
.model mn nmos(level=2 vto=0.75 tox=25n nsub=1.2e16 xj=0.3u ld=0.1u uo=520 ucrit=2e4
+ uexp=0.15 vmax=5e4 neff=2 nfs=1e11 delta=0.5 cgso=0.4n cgdo=0.4n cgbo=0.2n
+ cj=0.5m cjsw=0.4n mjsw=0.33 rd=40 rs=30)
.model mp pmos(level=2 vto=-0.85 tox=25n nsub=1.5e16 xj=0.3u ld=0.1u uo=210 ucrit=3e4
+ uexp=0.2 lambda=0.04 cgso=0.4n cgdo=0.4n cgbo=0.2n cj=0.6m cjsw=0.45n js=1e-4)
* RELTOL is tightened so that C's own Newton stopping error at the bias
* point stays below the 1 ppm small-signal bound (as in m7_mos1_process_dc).
.options temp=75 reltol=1e-7 vntol=1e-12 abstol=1e-18
.ac dec 5 1k 10g
.end
